From 0915ea69cd8ca49eeb018fe14f3fd2f49548a001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 05:46:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(ui): re-render the stale egui_tool_editor golden

The golden predates #244/#162; the current render differs only by a
20-pixel sliver of the properties panel's scrollbar (the catalog/panel
content height changed). Not a crash - the earlier ptr/mod.rs reading
was the snapshot assert's own panic. tool_editor_snapshot passes twice
in a row against the new image on a tree whose ui/app/tools sources
equal main f4e4eac.

Fixes #262

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../ui/tests/snapshots/egui_tool_editor.png   | Bin 239923 -> 239915 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

